/// causal — Causal inference library
///
/// Provides causal graph construction, do-calculus interventions,
/// causal discovery algorithms, and effect estimation.
///
/// ## Modules
///
/// - `base` — CausalGraph type, edge operations, d-separation
/// - `discovery` — PC algorithm, constraint-based structure learning
/// - `do_calculus` — Pearl's do-calculus interventions
/// - `refutation` — Placebo tests, random cause, subset validation
/// - `categorical` — Category-theoretic causal functors
/// - `transport` — Causal effect transportability
/// - `uplift` — Treatment effect estimation (CATE, ATE)
///
/// ## Quick Start
///
/// ```sio
/// use causal::base
///
/// fn main() with Mut, Div, Panic {
///     var g = cg_new(4)
///     cg_add_edge(&!g, 0, 1, 1.0)
///     cg_add_edge(&!g, 1, 2, 0.8)
///     cg_add_edge(&!g, 0, 3, 0.5)
/// }
/// ```

// Re-export modules — use `use causal::base`, `use causal::discovery`, etc.
